@october_mobilisations_2023
# prose-audit: Grade A — The Warsaw march and Katowice convention are competing organisations rather than interchangeable crowd claims; each attendance route requires host trust, retains the filed-list conflict and changes both the certified vote and formation channels.
title: One October, two mobilisations
subtitle: The March of a Million Hearts fills Warsaw while PiS answers from Katowice's Spodek
face-image: img/poland/events/million-hearts-march-2023.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 60
order: 1
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2023 and month = 10 and campaign_mobilisation_2023_done != 1
on-arrival: campaign_mobilisation_2023_done = 1; election_march_alignment = "Unsettled"; election_2023_left_mobilisation_bonus = 0; news_headline = "Warsaw and Katowice stage rival campaign mobilisations"

= 1 October 2023 — A street and an arena

Donald Tusk's **March of a Million Hearts** brings a vast opposition crowd
through central Warsaw two weeks before polling day. KO owns the call and the
main stage, but Left organisations have people, buses and banners inside the
procession. Joining can demonstrate a common democratic majority or reduce us
to one more logo in Tusk's closing image.

At the same hour PiS holds its **#BezpiecznaPolska** convention in Katowice's
Spodek. Several thousand supporters in an arena cannot match the Warsaw street,
but the scheduling is deliberate: public television receives a rival picture
of Kaczyński, Morawiecki and the governing party speaking about security
instead of broadcasting an unanswered opposition march.

[? if sejm_list_outcome = "pis_5": Our candidates are already filed on the PiS
host list. Katowice is therefore a campaign invitation; Warsaw would be a
public breach of host-list discipline.?]
[? if sejm_list_outcome != "pis_5": We have no place in the PiS campaign
delegation. The Katowice door is closed regardless of private contacts.?]

An invitation is not automatic. Each host will put Lewica's leadership on its
stage only if the working relationship is strong enough to survive the
photograph.

- @march23_million_hearts
- @march23_pis_convention
- @march23_independent

@march23_million_hearts
title: Join the March of a Million Hearts with a visible Left delegation
subtitle: Requires a KO relationship of at least 45. The larger mobilisation supplies the strongest turnout operation.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 45
unavailable-subtitle: KO will accept individual marchers, but relations below 45 do not buy Lewica an organised place in its closing mobilisation.
on-arrival: election_march_alignment = "Million Hearts March"; election_2023_left_mobilisation_bonus = 0.45; ko_relation += 6; pis_relation -= 4; pis_relation -= 8 if sejm_list_outcome = "pis_5"; turnout_readiness += 5; organiser_energy -= 3; urban_progressive_support += 3; progressive_credibility += 3; progressives_dissent -= 3; party_unity -= 3 if sejm_list_outcome = "pis_5"; campaign_march_broke_host_discipline = 1 if sejm_list_outcome = "pis_5"; news_headline = "A visible Left delegation joins the March of a Million Hearts"

Our stewards, candidates and local buses enter the Warsaw procession as one
named delegation. KO gets the broad democratic picture it wanted; Lewica gets
a field operation and enough red banners that the day cannot be edited into a
single-party rally.

[? if sejm_list_outcome = "pis_5": PiS calls the appearance a breach of the
filed campaign bargain. Progressive organisers welcome the refusal to
disappear into the host list, while every candidate place now depends on a
committee publicly embarrassed by its guest.?]
[? if sejm_list_outcome != "pis_5": The common march creates a working channel
that can be reused when the democratic clubs have to count votes after the
election.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Carry the Warsaw organisation into polling day

@march23_pis_convention
title: Take the PiS host-list delegation to the Katowice convention
subtitle: Only candidates filed with PiS can attend, and the PiS relationship must be at least 45. The smaller mobilisation buys access rather than a mass turnout wave.
view-if: sejm_list_outcome = "pis_5"
choose-if: pis_relation >= 45
unavailable-subtitle: Our names are on the host list, but relations below 45 do not earn a delegation on the PiS stage.
on-arrival: election_march_alignment = "PiS convention"; election_2023_left_mobilisation_bonus = 0.15; pis_relation += 6; ko_relation -= 8; turnout_readiness += 1; social_patriot_support += 6; rural_support += 2; left_cultural_position += 3; left_right_score += 3; coalition_blur += 5; progressives_dissent += 10; spring_dissent += 8; razem_dissent += 9; news_headline = "Lewica's PiS-list delegation appears at the Katowice convention"

Our host-list candidates sit beneath **#BezpiecznaPolska** and receive the
introductions the filing agreement promised. The hall is much smaller than the
Warsaw procession, but it reaches the governing party's television audience
and turns a legal list arrangement into a visible campaign alliance.

The social-patriotic current gains proof that PiS will share a stage.
Progressives, Wiosna and Razem see the same photograph as proof that the host
now owns more than the ballot line. The access will matter when Morawiecki asks
how many Left deputies still recognise the bargain after the count.

- @poland_event_queue: Carry the Katowice channel into polling day

@march23_independent
title: Keep off both stages and campaign under the filed programme
subtitle: Preserve campaign autonomy and build a smaller Left turnout operation.
on-arrival: election_march_alignment = "Independent Left campaign"; election_2023_left_mobilisation_bonus = 0.25; ko_relation -= 2; pis_relation -= 3 if sejm_list_outcome = "pis_5"; local_network += 2; turnout_readiness += 2; party_unity += 2; left_poll_momentum += 0.1; news_headline = "Lewica spends the day on its own candidates rather than either national stage"

Candidates stay in their districts, organisers work stations and housing
estates, and neither larger party receives our leadership in its picture. The
operation is smaller than Warsaw's and more useful to our own list than a seat
in Katowice.

[? if sejm_list_outcome = "pis_5": PiS accepts that guest candidates need
their own programme and notes the empty chairs. The host-list channel remains
open, but it is cooler when formation begins.?]
[? if sejm_list_outcome != "pis_5": KO describes the absence as another test
of whether Lewica wants a democratic majority or only its own result.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Take the separate campaign to polling day

